NATIVEXY - draw a crosshair at BASIC's (x, y) in the current graphics mode.

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD statement (NATIVEXY x, y)
  - the graphics coordinate modes (GMODE) matched between BASIC and native code
  - drawing through <graphics.h>

Try it
  NATIVEXY 100, 100 : PRINT GMODE

Build it on the machine
  grow nativexy          # -> build/NATIVEXY.SED
  (grow links the berry-libc from SEEDCORE.PKT for this one automatically)
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as NATIVEXY.SED, ready to use.

